// ********************************* STAGE 2: THE SICKNESS (AL-MARAD) *********************************
title: Shiekh_Khaled_stage2
tags: 
---
<<declare $shiekh_dead = false>>
<<declare $stage2_completed = false>>
<<declare $has_green_pill = false>>
<<declare $has_red_pill = false>>
<<declare $quest_fetch_pill = false>>

// Initial Condition: Check if he is already dead or recovered
<<if $shiekh_dead == true>>
    <<jump Stage3_Bad_Ghost>>
<<endif>>

<<if $stage2_completed == true>>
    <<jump Shiekh_Khaled_stage3_Good>>
<<endif>>

// ---------------------------------------------------------
// START STAGE 2: THE BUILD UP
// ---------------------------------------------------------

// He is clutching his chest (Using 'angry' as a pain spasm gesture)
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled angry>>
Old Khaled: ...*heavy, rattling breath*... Astaghfirullah...
Old Khaled: ...The walls of the chest are squeezing... like a grave closing in...

    -> "Sheikh Khaled! Are you okay?"
        <<gesture nod>> 
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
        Old Khaled: ...The heart is a bird, my son... and today... the cage is too tight.
        Old Khaled: ...Every soul must taste death... but perhaps... not this hour...
    -> "Do you need help? You look pale!"
        <<gesture wave>> 
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
        Old Khaled: ...It is the Constriction (*Qabd*)...
        Old Khaled: ...The breath refuses to enter... the shadows are gathering at the corners of my eyes...

// DRAMATIC PAUSE
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled angry>>
Old Khaled: ...*violent cough*...
Old Khaled: ...Listen to me... before the fog descends...

    -> "Just tell me what to do!"
        <<gesture nod>>
    -> "I will call for a doctor!"
        <<gesture shrug>>
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
        Old Khaled: ...No time... the doctor is far... but the cure is near...

// THE INSTRUCTION
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>>
Old Khaled: ...Inside... the cabinet...
Old Khaled: ...There is a **Green Bottle**... it is the colour of the olive leaf... the colour of life...
Old Khaled: ...Bring it to me...

<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
Old Khaled: ...But beware the **Red One**...
Old Khaled: ...It is fire... it is the heat of the fever... poison for a weak heart like mine.
Old Khaled: ...Do not mistake the fire for the garden... bring the **Green**... quickly...

// Set quest state
<<set $quest_fetch_pill = true>>
===

// ********************************* STAGE 2: RETURN WITH PILL *********************************

title: Shiekh_Khaled_PillReturn
---
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled angry>>
Old Khaled: ...*gasping for air*... The shadow waits... did you bring the light?

    // CHECK INVENTORY VARIABLES
    <<if $has_green_pill == true>>
        -> "I found the Green bottle, like the olive leaf."
            <<gesture wave>> 
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>> 
            Old Khaled: ...*shaking hands*... Alhamdulilah...
            Old Khaled: ...*swallows medicine*...
            
            <<wait 2.0>>
            
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
            Old Khaled: ...*long exhale*...
            Old Khaled: ...The constriction has passed... and the expansion (*Bast*) returns...
            
            Old Khaled: ...You listened well, young one.
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled cocky>>
            Old Khaled: ...In this life, many bottles look like medicine but are poison.
            Old Khaled: ...Only the one who listens to the description of the Guide finds the cure.
            
            <<set $lightHeartLevel = $lightHeartLevel + 20>>
            <<set $shiekh_dead = false>>
            <<set $stage2_completed = true>>
            <<jump Shiekh_Khaled_stage3_Good>>

    <<elseif $has_red_pill == true>>
        -> "I found this Red bottle."
            <<gesture wave>> 
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
            Old Khaled: ...Red?... No... *cough*...
            Old Khaled: ...Did I not say... the fire?...
            Old Khaled: ...You looked with your eyes... but not with your heart...
            
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
            Old Khaled: ...The Trust (*Amanah*)... was too heavy for you...
            Old Khaled: ...La ilaha illa Allah...
            
            Old Khaled: ...*eyes close slowly*...
            ...
            (Sheikh Khaled has passed away.)
            
            <<set $lightHeartLevel = $lightHeartLevel - 50>>
            <<set $shiekh_dead = true>>
            <<set $stage2_completed = true>>
            <<jump Stage3_Bad_Intro>>

    <<else>>
        -> "I couldn't find anything."
            <<gesture shrug>>
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled angry>>
            Old Khaled: ...Look again... my son...
            Old Khaled: ...Do not let the dust of the world blind you... Green... Cabinet...
    <<endif>>
===